---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import SubpageHero from '../../components/SubpageHero.astro';
import TourCard from '../../components/TourCard.astro';
import NewsletterBlock from '../../components/NewsletterBlock.astro';

const allTours = await getCollection('tours');
const allOperators = await getCollection('tourOperators');
const operatorMap = Object.fromEntries(allOperators.map(op => [op.data.slug, op.data]));

const wineTours = allTours.filter(t => t.data.experienceType === 'food-wine');

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'Tours', href: '/tour/' },
  { label: 'Wine Tours' },
];
export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mornington Peninsula Wine Tours · Peninsula Insider"
  description="Guided wine tours on the Mornington Peninsula - small-group cellar door days from Melbourne and private tastings on the Red Hill plateau. Honest operator comparisons."
  section="tour"
  canonical="https://peninsulainsider.com.au/tour/wine-tours/"
  modifiedTime="2026-04-29"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbItems} />

  <SubpageHero
    eyebrow="Tours"
    category="Wine &amp; Cellar Door"
    title="Peninsula Wine Tours"
    heroImage="/images/sourced/venue-montalto-banner-01.webp"
    imageAlt="Montalto Estate on the Mornington Peninsula - guided wine tours"
    imageCaption="Red Hill Plateau"
  >
    <div class="prose">
      <p>A guided wine tour removes the logistics of driving between cellar doors. You cover more ground, everyone in the group can drink, and a good guide adds the regional context that makes the difference between a pleasant day and a properly illuminating one.</p>
      <p>The Peninsula's wine tours split roughly into two types: small-group days from Melbourne that cover three to four cellar doors with transport included, and private charters that customise the itinerary to your group. Each suits a different kind of guest.</p>
    </div>
  </SubpageHero>

  <section class="experience-index experience-index--plain">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Small-group versus private</h2>
        <p>Small-group tours from Melbourne are the practical choice for couples or small parties who want a structured day without spending on a private charter. You share the bus with other guests, the cellar door sequence is set, and the lunch stop is included. Good value, efficient, and well-suited to first-time Peninsula visitors.</p>
        <p>Private charters suit groups of four or more who want to control the itinerary: longer time at specific estates, a lunch you've chosen in advance, and a vehicle that leaves and arrives when you want. The per-person cost is higher but the experience is proportionally better if you fill the vehicle.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="experience-index">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>Full day versus half day</h2>
        <p>A full-day wine tour from Melbourne covers three to four cellar doors and typically includes a winery lunch. Departure is around 8:30 am, return to Melbourne is between 5:30 and 7:00 pm. This is the standard format for guided Peninsula wine tours.</p>
        <p>Half-day formats exist but are rarer. They suit guests staying on the Peninsula who want a guided tasting session without a full vehicle tour. Worth checking operator options directly if a half-day format suits your plans.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {wineTours.length > 0 ? (
    <section class="experience-index experience-index--plain">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="venues__header">
          <div>
            <p class="label label--accent">Wine tours</p>
            <h2 class="venues__title">{wineTours.length} Peninsula wine {wineTours.length === 1 ? 'tour' : 'tours'}</h2>
            <p class="venues__sub">Sorted by publication date. Each entry includes a guide to who the tour suits.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tour-grid">
          {wineTours.map((tour) => (
            <TourCard tour={tour} operatorName={operatorMap[tour.data.operatorSlug]?.name} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  ) : (
    <section class="experience-index experience-index--plain">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Wine tour listings are being compiled. <a href="/tour/">Browse all Peninsula tours</a> or <a href="/wine/">explore the wine vertical</a> for cellar door guides.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  <section class="experience-index">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="venues__header">
        <div>
          <p class="label label--accent">Related</p>
          <h2 class="venues__title">More wine on the Peninsula</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="venues__grid venues__grid--links">
        <div class="pi-card"><div class="pi-card__body">
          <h3 class="pi-card__title"><a href="/wine/">Peninsula wine guide</a></h3>
          <p class="pi-card__dek">The cellar door guide - every estate we've assessed, with honest tasting notes and visit advice.</p>
          <div class="pi-card__actions"><a href="/wine/" class="pi-btn pi-btn--solid">Browse cellars &rarr;</a></div>
        </div></div>
        <div class="pi-card"><div class="pi-card__body">
          <h3 class="pi-card__title"><a href="/journal/mornington-peninsula-winery-guide/">Winery guide</a></h3>
          <p class="pi-card__dek">200+ vineyards, 9 sub-regions, and where to go for Pinot Noir, Chardonnay, and dog-friendly cellar doors. The editorial overview before you book.</p>
          <div class="pi-card__actions"><a href="/journal/mornington-peninsula-winery-guide/" class="pi-btn pi-btn--solid">Read the guide &rarr;</a></div>
        </div></div>
        <div class="pi-card"><div class="pi-card__body">
          <h3 class="pi-card__title"><a href="/tour/">All tours</a></h3>
          <p class="pi-card__dek">Beyond wine: hot springs, private charters, coastal walks, and multi-day Peninsula experiences.</p>
          <div class="pi-card__actions"><a href="/tour/" class="pi-btn pi-btn--solid">Browse all tours &rarr;</a></div>
        </div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <NewsletterBlock />
</BaseLayout>
